vh8uiKQsF_title","label":"ggvh8uiKQsF_title","default":"Is it suitable for dietary restrictions?"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHT0jYsk9f_text","label":"ggHT0jYsk9f_text","default":"<p>Yes! IM8 Daily Ultimate Essentials is vegan, gluten-free, allergen-free, contains no artificial flavors, no added sugar, and no artificial sweeteners. It is NSF Certified for Sport and suitable for most dietary needs.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPLmFSuk68_title","label":"ggPLmFSuk68_title","default":"How does the subscription work?"},{"type":"html","id":"ggf4naSQtTi_text","label":"ggf4naSQtTi_text","default":"<p>Our subscribe-and-save option delivers IM8 to your door on a regular schedule at a discounted price. You can update, pause, or cancel your subscription at any time with no commitment. All subscriptions include free shipping.</p>"}],
